  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 17F03_PostReplay_B
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: 17F03_PostReplay_B
  notes: '17F03 option B result excluding the conditional warning. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md,
    stable marker 17F03_PostReplay_B. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Observation period filed under chapter nineteen. I read your intent as
      seven days of direct communication without system assistance.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: What do you mean you're not turning it back on?
    holdSeconds: 4.923585
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: It's staying off for now, ma'am. The company will send someone twice a
      week for the next seven days.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: Seven days? Then who's supposed to keep an eye on Ava?
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: I'm sorry. It's procedure. Maybe it gives you and Mark some room to talk
      to Ava yourselves.
    holdSeconds: 7.565094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Laura
    text: When, exactly? We barely have time to breathe. That's what the unit is
      for.
    holdSeconds: 6.4330187
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mark
    text: Laura, let it go. She's doing her job.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
